# The Paladin's single-target swing: ten strikes into three enemies, where
# Divine Charge spreads four across eight. What it is really for is a boss, and
# the game has none yet -- so it ships as the swing a Paladin reaches for when
# there is one thing left standing.
#
# 780ms is chosen rather than measured: heavier than the hammer and lighter
# than Heaven's Hammer, which is where ten strikes of this size belong.
